msgstr "更轻松的在线购物与销售平台"

#: templates/stores/landing.html:13
msgid "Bring your shop closer to your customers."
msgstr "拉近您的店铺与顾客之间的距离。"

#: templates/stores/landing.html:16
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Taliawale helps local shop owners show their products online and "
"receive orders.\n"
"        Customers can discover nearby stores, choose what they need, and "
"order with ease.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Taliawale 帮助本地店家在线展示商品并接收订单。\n"
"        顾客可以轻松探索附近店铺、选择心仪商品并在线下单。\n"
"        "

#: templates/stores/landing.html:32
msgid "Check Other Stores"
msgstr "查看其他店铺"

#: templates/stores/landing.html:38
msgid "A shop owner showing products through an online store"
msgstr "通过网店展示商品的店家"

#: templates/stores/landing.html:45
msgid "What is Taliawale?"
msgstr "什么是 Taliawale？"

#: templates/stores/landing.html:47
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Taliawale is an online marketplace for local shops and their customers.\n"
"    It gives store owners a simple place to present their shop, list their "
"products,\n"
"    manage orders, and connect with customers. For customers, it makes it "
"easier to\n"
"    find stores, browse products, place orders, and keep track of them.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Taliawale 是一个服务于本地店铺及其顾客的在线市场。\n"
"    它为店主提供了一个便捷的平台来展示店铺、列出商品、\n"
"    管理订单并与顾客建立联系。对于顾客而言，它可以更方便地\n"
"    查找店铺、浏览商品、下单并跟踪订单状态。\n"
"    "

#: templates/stores/landing.html:58
msgid "For Store Owners"
msgstr "面向店家"

#: templates/stores/landing.html:60
msgid ""
"\n"
"      Create your store, add your products, share your store link, and "
"receive orders\n"
"      from customers. You can keep your information and orders organized in "
"one place.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"      创建您的店铺、添加商品、分享店铺链接并接收顾客订单。\n"
"      您可以在一个地方管理所有店铺信息与订单。\n"
"      "

#: templates/stores/landing.html:67
msgid "For Customers"
msgstr "面向顾客"

#: templates/stores/landing.html:69
msgid ""
"\n"
"      Check stores, browse available products, place an order, and follow "
"its progress.\n"
"      You can also contact us if you need help using the platform.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"      查看店铺、浏览选购商品、提交订单并跟踪进度。\n"
"      如果您在平台使用过程中需要帮助，也可以随时联系我们。\n"
"      "

